Description: Keyboard-first app switcher for deepin
 DeepSwitch maps global hotkeys to desktop applications, launching missing
 apps and focusing or cycling existing windows. It runs as a user-session
 application and exposes a Qt Quick settings UI; it is not a system daemon.
 .
 键盘优先的应用切换器，通过全局快捷键启动、聚焦或切换应用程序窗口。
